      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, no, don’t do that. After a few sips, the taste\nreally started to grow on me. Now I’m hooked!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "People do sometimes make coffee drinks with salt\nadded, don’t they?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500065006F0070006C006500200064006F00200073006F006D006500740069006D006500730020006D0061006B006500200063006F00660066006500650020006400720069006E006B007300200077006900740068002000730061006C0074000A00610064006400650064002C00200064006F006E2019007400200074006800650079003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You should make this salted coffee a part of your\nregular menu!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000730068006F0075006C00640020006D0061006B006500200074006800690073002000730061006C00740065006400200063006F006600660065006500200061002000700061007200740020006F006600200079006F00750072000A0072006500670075006C006100720020006D0065006E007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wh-what?! I mean...er...yes, fine idea. We’ll\nconsider doing just that.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A nice aromatic coffee with a dash of Nacli salt...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020006E006900630065002000610072006F006D006100740069006300200063006F00660066006500650020007700690074006800200061002000640061007300680020006F00660020004E00610063006C0069002000730061006C0074002E002E002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I tried to make the perfect blend, but I think it’s\nstill too salty for most people.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’ll just keep it as a part of our secret menu for\nthose in the know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 162
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Everyone’s tastes do differ, after all.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3940,
